# Credentials live client-side only — the daemon has no .env, and that is
# deliberate.
#
# SUBSCRIPTION-BILLED (adapter: claude-code) — the default for live runs.
# Run `claude setup-token` once (browser flow) and paste the token here.
# Completions then route through the Claude Code CLI and bill your Claude
# subscription. Alternatively run /login inside `claude` once and leave
# this unset — the CLI holds its own credentials.
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=sk-ant-oat01-...
#
# API-CREDIT-BILLED (adapter: claude) — the plain Anthropic SDK. This
# ALWAYS bills organization API credits: via the key below, or silently via
# an `ant auth login` OAuth profile if one exists on this machine. There is
# no subscription path for raw Messages API calls. Only set this when you
# mean to spend credits.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api...
